<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps rates Chrysler debentures A-.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps rates Chrysler debentures A-.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Friday it assigned a Single A Minus rating to the $600 million of 7.45 percent debentures due March 1, 2027 issued by Chrysler Corp.</p>
<p>Chrysler has delivered the best profit margins among North American automakers over the last five years due to its strong shares in the growing light truck segments and a comparatively low-cost structure, Duff &amp; Phelps said.</p>
<p>It also said Chrysler has been successful in developing new products.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
